  "body": "Part of #769 (PR #770). The GUI axis panel now applies AlignPartToSetup::align_from_axes (two picks define the full 3D frame, +Z by the right-hand rule), but the MCP tool set_part_axes (crates/app/src/mcp/align_tools.rs) still calls turn_in_plane, so an agent cannot reach the full-3D alignment and a left-handed in-plane pair is flipped by the GUI but refused over MCP.\n\nDone means: set_part_axes (or a new tool) routes through align_from_axes when both +Y and +X are given, with an MCP test pinning the full-3D landing and the left-handed pair, and the camcraft-mcp skill row updated.",
